From cf0a74acae8816e48d4eabf5797d1ecf6ff37e25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dave Hart <hart@ntp.org>
Date: Mon, 2 Sep 2024 17:01:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Pull changes by Dave Hart <hart@ntp.org> after 4.2.8p18

[Bug 3943] 4.2.8p18 ignores link-local IPv6 server.
[Bug 3942] DECL_SYSCALL detection does not work on illumos.
[Bug 3940] ntpd 4.2.8p18 regression from p17 for digests longer than 160
           bits.
[Bug 3933] Restrict structure misaligned on SPARC64.
[Bug 3932] Ignore teredo interfaces in Windows ntpd.
[Bug 3931] Libopts is not respecting VPATH.
[Bug 3930] Windows build mkver.bat races itself.
[Bug 3929] 4.2.8p18 -Werror -Wincompatible-pointer-types breaks w/md5.h.
           Wrap MD5Update() calls for varying declarations.
[Bug 3928] ntpd 4.2.8p18 crash when bringing up net interface fails.
[Bug 3927] 4.2.8p18 configure reverses -L and -l in $LIBS for OpenSSL test.
           Reported by Brian Utterback.
[Bug 3926] pthread_detach() not detected with gcc 14, clang 16.
           Use pthread_t arg in openldap-thread-check.m4.
[Bug 3925] ntpd on Windows 8 and later doesn't set CMOS clock at shutdown.
[Bug 3924] Windows ntpd gives up on DNS too quickly at OS startup.
           Increase max. DNS retry interval from 32 to 1024 seconds.
[Bug 3877] 4.2.8p16 client rejects server response with zero ppoll.

Display SSL shared library version number in human form.
Reorder restrict_u layout to improve alignment on all platforms.
Correct match_restrict[46]_addr() logic expiring temporary restrictions.
Rename is_ip_address() to sau_from_string() to better reflect use.
Remove include/safecast.h
Fix bug in m4sh macro NTP_FACILITYNAMES that meant detection always failed.
